@host = http://localhost:5080
@apiKey = dev-admin-key-change-me
@device = livingroom
# Paste the token from the create response here:
@token = paste-token-here

### Setup page
GET {{host}}/setup/

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### List devices
GET {{host}}/api/devices
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Create a device (the token is returned only once)
POST {{host}}/api/devices
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{device}}",
  "name": "Living room",
  "intervalSeconds": 900,
  "nightStart": "23:00",
  "nightEnd": "06:00",
  "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin",
  "lowBattMv": 3300
}

### Get one device
GET {{host}}/api/devices/{{device}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Update settings (partial; "" clears nightStart/nightEnd/pendingUrl)
PUT {{host}}/api/devices/{{device}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intervalSeconds": 1800,
  "pendingUrl": ""
}

### Rotate the token
POST {{host}}/api/devices/{{device}}/token
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Upload an image (contain + dither)
POST {{host}}/api/devices/{{device}}/image?fit=contain&dither=true
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WallBoundary

--WallBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./photo.png
--WallBoundary--

### Paste an image unscaled at x,y onto the current image
POST {{host}}/api/devices/{{device}}/image?x=700&y=20
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WallBoundary

--WallBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="badge.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./badge.png
--WallBoundary--

### PNG preview of the current image
GET {{host}}/api/devices/{{device}}/image.png
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Device update call (what the panel sends)
GET {{host}}/api/panel/{{device}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Fw: 0.1.0
X-Batt-mV: 3950
X-Rssi: -58
X-Boot: init
User-Agent: WallISetup/0.1.0

### Device update call with the ETag it has (304 or region)
GET {{host}}/api/panel/{{device}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-None-Match: "0000000000000000"
X-Fw: 0.1.0
X-Batt-mV: 3950
X-Rssi: -58
X-Boot: timer
User-Agent: WallISetup/0.1.0

### Delete the device
DELETE {{host}}/api/devices/{{device}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
